  "ruleText": "Agr 3701.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to assure the adequate treatment of horses, including all other equine species.\n\nSource. #7989, eff 11-21-03, EXPIRED: 11-21-11\n\nNew. #10105, eff 4-4-12",
